# Clawdemy License

Clawdemy uses a three-way license model. Different parts of the repository and
the audio narration are released under different licenses, so pick the one that
matches the content you are reusing.

---

## Lesson text content: Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International

The following content is licensed under **CC BY-NC-SA 4.0**:

- All lesson prose, diagrams, quizzes, summaries, and references under
  `src/content/docs/**` except code samples
- Article prose under `src/content/docs/articles/**` when that directory exists
- Planning documents under `Doc/**` and `HANDOVER.md`, `CLAUDE.md`

You are free to:

- **Share**, copy and redistribute the material in any medium or format
- **Adapt**, remix, transform, and build upon the material for non-commercial
  purposes

Under the following terms:

- **Attribution**: you must give appropriate credit, provide a link to the
  license, and indicate if changes were made
- **NonCommercial**: you may not use the material for commercial purposes
  without express permission
- **ShareAlike**: if you remix, transform, or build upon the material, you
  must distribute your contributions under the same license

For commercial use inquiries (paid training programs, courseware vendors,
employee learning platforms, ad-supported reproductions, etc.) please contact
`licensing@clawdemy.org`. See `https://clawdemy.org/legal/licensing/` for the
detailed policy on what is permissible without permission and what requires a
commercial license.

Recommended attribution string:

> Adapted from Clawdemy (https://clawdemy.org), licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.

Full license text: <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/legalcode>

---

## Audio narration: All Rights Reserved

The following content is **All Rights Reserved (Copyright © 2026 RBJ Global LLC)**:

- All AI-narrated MP3 audio files served from `https://audio.clawdemy.org/lessons/`
  and any local backup copies under `public/audio/`
- The "Listen to this lesson" audio embedded on each lesson page
- The Clawdemy Lessons podcast feed at `https://clawdemy.org/podcast/feed.xml`

Listeners may consume Clawdemy audio via legitimate podcast platforms (Apple
Podcasts, Spotify, Pocket Casts, and similar) where the show is officially
distributed. Re-hosting, restreaming, repackaging, or converting Clawdemy audio
into derivative works (video, transcripts as primary content, paid courses,
etc.) requires explicit permission. The RSS feed advertises this posture via
the Podcasting 2.0 `<podcast:license>` and `<podcast:locked>` tags.

The audio license is intentionally narrower than the lesson text license
because audio represents significant marginal cost (per-lesson TTS generation)
and is the basis of an evolving Clawdemy YouTube companion channel.

For audio licensing inquiries please contact `licensing@clawdemy.org`.

